# A BLOCK SCALAR IN A PATTERN BLOCK. format_design gives a block's
# `description` the full prose-value production, which includes `|`; the
# lexical rules say a pattern block's lines are not indented, and a block
# scalar IS indented continuation. Both cannot hold, and the body's rule
# wins. Refused by name, in every parser, with the reason stated.
pattern a+
description |
  this cannot work here
m "aaa" 0 3
